  "attempts": "Review and a new independent processor-reset oracle corrected the initial preserve-threshold/output-bound proposal. The first Linux build driver reached its 1200-second deadline during linking; no owned build processes remained before retry, and later attempts allow 7200 seconds. One installed Python check exposed empty ROI lists arriving through the legacy string-list metadata alternative; decoding now accepts JSON array semantics and still rejects malformed entries. An indexed fixture was corrected to supply the documented UInt8 ndarray. Earlier variant sources/logs are retained or archived. A mounted-file fingerprint remained stale after a Windows edit, so final 004 uses an independently written manifest plus actual native compiled source hashes and an immutable native test snapshot. CRC/member-SHA verification precedes exact observed temporary fixture/environment/snapshot/cache deletion; qualified installs, probes, logs and JUnit remain.",
